                   --------------------------
                   Maven Options
                   --------------------------

Maven Options

 The RAT Maven plugin has many of the same options as the command line as well as a few that are specific to the Maven
  environment. The argument types specified in the list below are defined in the section following.

 By default the RAT Maven plugin excludes the MAVEN standard collection as well as the defined project build directory.
  If there is a need to include any of these the MAVEN standard collection can be added to
  \<inputIncludeStd\> and the project build directory can be added to \<inputInclude\> using the standard expression syntax.

* The Maven Options

#foreach ($mavenOption in ${mavenOptions.mappedOptions.sorted().toList()})

** ${mavenOption.name}

  #if(${mavenOption.isDeprecated})<<${mavenOption.getDeprecated}>>
  #end


  ${mavenOption.description}

  <<Argument type:>> #if(${mavenOption.hasArg})  ${mavenOption.argName} - ${mavenOption.argType.description.get()}
  #else  boolean - 'true' or 'false'
  #end

  Example:

----

${mavenOption.example}

---

#end
